// §5 "Worth knowing" — ✅ REWRITTEN (copy-rewrite brief §10). This was
// verbatim client copy and it is still the strongest argument on the page;
// what changed is where the argument lands.
//
// It works because it explains something the reader doesn't know, and it
// converts by making the reader distrust the cheapest quote rather than by
// making claims about TLB.
//
// THREE CHANGES, all of them §9.4 or §9.2:
//
//  1. "THE BILL YOU DO NOT SEE IS THE ONE YOU PAY LATER, IN DIRTY GLASS,
//     MISSED BINS AND A CLEANER WHO QUIETLY STOPS TURNING UP." Cut. BFD §9.4
//     rules out characterising what another cleaner fails to do in running
//     text — comparisons belong in the table, where a row can stay neutral
//     and factual — and a competitor's cleaner abandoning the site is the
//     sharpest version of exactly that. It is replaced by arithmetic about
//     the reader's own quote: the gap is hours or tasks, so find out which
//     before comparing numbers. Same conclusion, no prediction about
//     somebody else's staff.
//  2. THE SPLIT. Paragraph one ran seven sentences. BFD §9.2 sets three to
//     four; both halves now sit inside it.
//  3. "THAT COSTS MORE BECAUSE THE AWARD SAYS SO, NOT BECAUSE WE HAVE ADDED
//     A MARGIN" becomes the specific conditions that trigger the penalty.
//     More useful to the reader, more citable by an AI assistant per BFD
//     §14, and the defensive clause was answering an accusation nobody made.
//
// ✅ THE AWARD IS NOW NAMED IN FULL on first mention, which closes the open
// decision the old comment recorded: it was "the Cleaning Services Award"
// here and "Cleaning Services Award 2020" in the non-branded FAQs.
//
// ✅ VERIFIED. The Cleaning Services Award 2020 (MA000022) is a real Fair Work
// modern award and it does cover employers in the contract cleaning services
// industry throughout Australia. Fair Work Ombudsman,
// https://awards.fairwork.gov.au/MA000022.html, checked 17 September 2026.
//
// ⚠️ RE-CHECK BY 1 JULY 2027. Award rates and penalty conditions are reset
