// §12 Non-branded FAQs — all five drafted, none bracketed. Genuinely strong
// long-tail content, better than anything a local competitor will have.
//
// ⚠️ VERIFICATION PASS REQUIRED — lighter than the NDIS page's, but real.
// These claims are checkable and dated:
//   - Cleaning Services Award 2020 (MA000022) sets a legal minimum for
//     contract cleaners. Correct. Rates are reviewed ANNUALLY by the Fair
//     Work Commission — the claim is durable, any specific rate would not be.
//   - Early/late weekday shifts, weekends and public holidays attract
//     penalty rates. Correct in substance; confirm the phrasing covers shift
//     loadings vs. overtime accurately.
//   - Providers supply equipment, chemicals and safety data sheets. Correct
//     and standard — SDS provision is a WHS obligation, not a courtesy, and
//     could be stated more strongly.
//   - In NSW, child-related work requires a current Working With Children
